ted-quantifier-block</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 4.20, Eq.(4.21), pp.63–64, DjVu scans 78–79"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；已核对结构归纳证明与逐轮替换论证"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为已含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max\\)</span> 的有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow=\\tau\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow=\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau\">\\(R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\">\\(\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0de5e873dd7a7151\" href=\"?note=0de5e873dd7a7151\" title=\"29-df-inductive-def\">29-df-inductive-def</a>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0d59539a54286933\" href=\"?note=0d59539a54286933\" title=\"29-df-positivity\">29-df-positivity</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_r^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(R_r^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0de5e873dd7a7151\" href=\"?note=0de5e873dd7a7151\" title=\"29-df-inductive-def\">29-df-inductive-def</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\">\\(\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[QB]^r\\theta\">\\([QB]^r\\theta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_2\">\\(\\models_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a>；输入采用其中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span> 与扩张映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\">\\(A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\bot}\">\\(\\theta_{\\bot}\\)</span> 是下式定义的量词自由恒假公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\cup\\epsilon\">\\(\\beta\\cup\\epsilon\\)</span> 为域赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 与布尔赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:B_b\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\epsilon:B_b\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的合并。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是有限非空结构类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span> 是域赋值集合，分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|A|^k\">\\(X\\subseteq|A|^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均作全称量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\cup\\epsilon\">\\(\\beta\\cup\\epsilon\\)</span> 是两个不交定义域函数的集合并：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\epsilon)=B_b\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\epsilon)=B_b\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\\cap B_b=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\cap B_b=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[QB]R(\\bar x)\">\\([QB]R(\\bar x)\\)</span> 的双排序语义实例化于词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}\">\\(\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[QB]^r\\theta_{\\bot}\">\\([QB]^r\\theta_{\\bot}\\)</span> 的语义实例化于词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。两处均使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 的相同递归，而不是把含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的公式送入不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的语法域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists v\\geq k\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\;\\forall A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\\;\\forall X\\subseteq|A|^k\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}^{B_b}\\quad\\left(A[R:=X]\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A[R:=X]\\models_2[QB]R(\\bar x)[\\beta\\cup\\epsilon]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists v\\geq k\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\;\\forall A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\\;\\forall X\\subseteq|A|^k\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}^{B_b}\\quad\\left(A[R:=X]\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A[R:=X]\\models_2[QB]R(\\bar x)[\\beta\\cup\\epsilon]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists v\\geq k\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\;\\forall A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}^{B_b}\\quad\\left(\\beta(\\bar x)\\in R_r^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models_2[QB]^r\\theta_{\\bot}[\\beta\\cup\\epsilon]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists v\\geq k\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\;\\forall A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}^{B_b}\\quad\\left(\\beta(\\bar x)\\in R_r^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models_2[QB]^r\\theta_{\\bot}[\\beta\\cup\\epsilon]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\bot}\\coloneqq\\neg(x_1=x_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_{\\bot}\\coloneqq\\neg(x_1=x_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 4.20 及式(4.21)，印刷页63–64、扫描页78–79。已核对证明的原子、无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的量词自由、个体量词及合取/析取分支：重绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 可在量词块末端保留唯一一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\bar x)\">\\(R(\\bar x)\\)</span>；额外布尔选择量词处理分支。所有保护公式均不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。第二式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时对应空关系，每次把末端 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 替换成上一轮重复块，得到下一轮迭代。布尔论域独立于输入域，因此该接口也适用于单元素结构。为与既有量词块词汇接口完全一致，本条限定为已经含序及端点的输入扩张；不将公式在不存在的扩张符号上求值。这里给出块展开本身；没有额外宣称任意未构造的时间函数都可由机器实现。</p>\n<p>本轮同步量词块的完整数值扩张接口；已经包含所有保留数值符号的条件使 tau^uparrow=tau 真正成立。标准解释及单元素数值约定均继承该上游。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-inductive-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-positivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为已含 $<,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max$ 的有限关系词汇，$\\tau^\\uparrow=\\tau$；$R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau$，$k\\geq1$；$\\varphi(R,\\bar x)$ 满足 [[29-df-inductive-def]]，且 $\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)$，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为已含 $<,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max$ 的有限关系词汇，$\\tau^\\uparrow=\\tau$；$R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau$，$k\\geq1$；$\\varphi(R,\\bar x)$ 满足 [[29-df-inductive-def]]，且 $\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)$，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$、$R_r^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 见 [[29-df-inductive-def]]；$\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}$、$[QB]^r\\theta$ 与 $\\models_2$ 见 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]；输入采用其中的 $\\mathcal O_\\tau$ 与扩张映射 $E_\\tau$，$A\\in E_\\tau[\\mathcal O_\\tau]$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ 是有限非空结构类，$\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$ 是域赋值集合，分别见 [[29-df-struc]]、[[29-df-assignment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ 是有限非空结构类，$\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$ 是域赋值集合，分别见 [[29-df-struc]]、[[29-df-assignment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta\\cup\\epsilon$ 是两个不交定义域函数的集合并：$\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathrm{